1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:02,144
???
This is an announcement.

2
00:00:02,144 --> 00:00:06,976
Due to budget cuts, this episode will be
using puppets instead of being animated.

3
00:00:08,544 --> 00:00:10,608
Hey, Pencil! How's it going?

4
00:00:10,608 --> 00:00:13,344
Oh, nothing. Just looking at clouds.

5
00:00:13,696 --> 00:00:16,128
Watching clouds, huh? You seem pretty bored.

6
00:00:16,128 --> 00:00:18,976
Let's go do something fun, like jumping off a cliff!

7
00:00:19,712 --> 00:00:21,872
Pencil! I didn't mean it literally!

8
00:00:22,192 --> 00:00:24,768
WEE-oh, you didn't mean it literally?

9
00:00:24,768 --> 00:00:25,120
No.

10
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,752
So, we're not cliff jumping?

11
00:00:26,752 --> 00:00:27,440
No.

12
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,320
Oooweh!

13
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,192
Let's watch clouds with Pen!

14
00:00:30,192 --> 00:00:31,104
Yeah!

15
00:00:31,104 --> 00:00:32,272
Oooaaah!

16
00:00:32,272 --> 00:00:34,384
Why, in fact, I am!

17
00:00:34,384 --> 00:00:35,472
Doing what?

18
00:00:35,472 --> 00:00:37,792
Ohhh, you knooow!

19
00:00:37,792 --> 00:00:39,790
Oh, cool! I want one!

20
00:00:40,064 --> 00:00:41,104
Weuuueuuugh!

21
00:00:41,104 --> 00:00:42,112
AWESOME!

22
00:00:42,368 --> 00:00:44,096
I want one, too!

23
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:46,416
Yay! I have one, too!

24
00:00:47,376 --> 00:00:49,264
AHHHHH!

25
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:51,408
AEEEEEEHHHH!

26
00:00:51,472 --> 00:00:54,560
AEEUUGHUHAEUXXHEAUHEAUHHH!

27
00:00:55,328 --> 00:00:59,696
Ha-ha-ha! These losers look like they're
having so much fun with their dolls!

28
00:00:59,696 --> 00:01:00,560
Yeah!

29
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,632
Ah, phew!

30
00:01:02,112 --> 00:01:02,640
Rah!

31
00:01:03,536 --> 00:01:04,528
Phew!

32
00:01:05,456 --> 00:01:08,336
Reueuuuuughhhh heeuuuugh!

33
00:01:08,336 --> 00:01:09,024
Yuh!

34
00:01:09,168 --> 00:01:10,544
I've been rescued!

35
00:01:10,864 --> 00:01:14,688
YAAAAAY!

36
00:01:14,688 --> 00:01:17,648
HEEUUUGHHHBUOOHUHBHHCHHSH!

37
00:01:17,648 --> 00:01:19,840
BLAAAHAAKEBUSHAAAA!

38
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:21,136
AAAAAAAAA!

39
00:01:21,136 --> 00:01:22,288
SPONGY:
Hi.

40
00:01:22,288 --> 00:01:24,432
Spongy, what happened to you?

41
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,272
Wha?

42
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,960
It's great to be puppets!

43
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:35,488
Yay! This is awesome! Ha-ha-ha!
This is the best thing ever! Yay! Woo-hoo!

44
00:01:35,488 --> 00:01:40,944
Yay! Hoo-ray! Hoo-rah! Waa-yaa-yaa!
Yaaaay! Yaaa-haaaay! A-ha, yay!

45
00:01:40,944 --> 00:01:42,816
APRIL FOOLS!

46
00:01:42,944 --> 00:01:45,344
You were fooled, weren't you? Ha, ha.

47
00:01:45,344 --> 00:01:47,600
Ha-ha! Even I was fooled!

48
00:01:48,032 --> 00:01:54,720
♪ [INTRO PLAYS] ♪

49
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,720
Subtitles: Daniel Adam Valle

50
00:01:57,600 --> 00:02:00,240
Last episode, Rocky's barfing habits,

51
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:02,512
Bubble's love for ice cream, and Pen's cheating

52
00:02:02,512 --> 00:02:04,880
caused them to fall into the danger zone.

53
00:02:05,328 --> 00:02:08,864
Now, it's time to see which of
the three of you will be eliminated.

54
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:11,376
♪ OMG! There's points now ♪

55
00:02:11,376 --> 00:02:14,256
♪ Who'll go home? We'll just see... ♪

56
00:02:14,256 --> 00:02:19,856
♪ It's Cake at Staaake! ♪

57
00:02:20,592 --> 00:02:23,264
So, this time, we have a blueberry pie.

58
00:02:23,264 --> 00:02:24,112
Yoy-mm!

59
00:02:24,112 --> 00:02:26,432
But be gentle, because it's explosive.

60
00:02:26,432 --> 00:02:28,144
Uh-explosive!?

61
00:02:28,144 --> 00:02:30,528
So if you get some pie, you are safe.

62
00:02:30,944 --> 00:02:33,024
If you don't, you will be eliminated.

63
00:02:33,424 --> 00:02:36,320
Anyway, we got 259 votes.

64
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:37,728
That's not very many!

65
00:02:37,728 --> 00:02:39,264
No, it's not.

66
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:43,392
Regardless, we have another
large crowd watching this event today.

67
00:02:45,888 --> 00:02:49,264
I like to keep things private. Moving on...

68
00:02:49,264 --> 00:02:52,256
Since Pencil, Spongy, Firey, Blocky,

69
00:02:52,256 --> 00:02:56,400
Tennis Ball, Leafy, and Ice Cube
were not in the danger zone,

70
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,392
they are safe.

71
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,936
There are only two slices left.

72
00:03:04,896 --> 00:03:05,888
Bubble...

73
00:03:05,888 --> 00:03:09,072
you only got twenty-three votes, so you are safe.

74
00:03:09,424 --> 00:03:10,224
Yoya!

75
00:03:10,224 --> 00:03:11,904
Now it's down to Pen and Rocky.

76
00:03:12,512 --> 00:03:13,584
Let's show the votes.

77
00:03:13,584 --> 00:03:15,920
[DRUM ROLL]

78
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,920
[CRASH!]

79
00:03:18,816 --> 00:03:20,416
That means Rocky is safe...

80
00:03:21,552 --> 00:03:23,216
...and Pen will be eliminated.

81
00:03:27,808 --> 00:03:30,800
Now that Pen is gone,
you are the final nine contestants.

82
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,760
YAY!

83
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:32,928
Isn't that wonderful?

84
00:03:32,928 --> 00:03:34,816
Yes! That IS wonderful!

85
00:03:34,816 --> 00:03:37,504
So anyway, these are your current scores.

86
00:03:38,784 --> 00:03:40,992
So, who's going to be up for elimination?

87
00:03:40,992 --> 00:03:42,990
Shush. I'll get to that later.

88
00:03:42,990 --> 00:03:45,552
The sixteenth contest is a bowling contest.

89
00:03:45,552 --> 00:03:46,240
Yay!

90
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:49,616
Since armless people cannot
bowl, they are disqualified.

91
00:03:49,616 --> 00:03:50,944
Aww!

92
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,776
So, let's get down to business.

93
00:03:54,144 --> 00:03:57,328
We will go in alphabetical order, so Blocky is first.

94
00:03:57,328 --> 00:03:58,576
Okay! Hyup!

95
00:04:01,184 --> 00:04:04,064
You only get one shot, so Bubble is next.

96
00:04:04,064 --> 00:04:05,120
Whoaaa!

97
00:04:06,784 --> 00:04:07,760
Ha-ha!

98
00:04:07,888 --> 00:04:08,560
Hyeh!

99
00:04:10,784 --> 00:04:12,448
Yeah, let's do this!

100
00:04:14,832 --> 00:04:16,176
WHAAATEEEVAAA!

101
00:04:16,256 --> 00:04:17,696
Pencil is last. Go.

102
00:04:17,696 --> 00:04:18,592
Yeah!

103
00:04:21,728 --> 00:04:22,608
So that's it.

104
00:04:22,608 --> 00:04:26,288
Yay! So do I get points for the pins I knock down?

105
00:04:26,288 --> 00:04:29,312
Nope. This time, you get to take away points.

106
00:04:29,776 --> 00:04:35,120
For every pin you knock down, you can subtract
thirty points from any other contestant's score.

107
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:35,920
[GASP!]

108
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,232
So, let's begin.

109
00:04:37,408 --> 00:04:39,456
Leafy, you knocked down three pins.

110
00:04:39,856 --> 00:04:43,344
You can subtract ninety points.
What is your decision?

111
00:04:43,344 --> 00:04:44,384
Hmm...

112
00:04:44,384 --> 00:04:47,040
I think it's pretty obvious what I want: EQUALITY!

113
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,416
Ten points off everyone.

114
00:04:50,576 --> 00:04:55,008
Pencil, with five pins,
you can subtract 150 points.

115
00:04:55,248 --> 00:04:56,048
What do you want?

116
00:04:56,048 --> 00:04:58,768
Same as Leafy, but I gotta stick with my alliance.

117
00:04:58,940 --> 00:05:02,048
So that means twenty-five
points off everyone else.

118
00:05:04,784 --> 00:05:08,768
Blocky, your seven pins mean
you can subtract 210 points.

119
00:05:08,768 --> 00:05:11,104
Okay, let's see...

120
00:05:11,104 --> 00:05:13,456
Let's drain away all of Bubble's points.

121
00:05:17,776 --> 00:05:20,064
Oh, no-io-ho!

122
00:05:20,064 --> 00:05:22,800
You have 112 points left to subtract.

123
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:26,720
Great! I'll take away fifty-six points
from Leafy and Pencil each

124
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:29,104
for even thinking about lowering my score!

125
00:05:32,112 --> 00:05:32,800
Grr!

126
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:36,496
Finally, Firey. You can subtract 300 points.

127
00:05:36,496 --> 00:05:38,656
Ooh, that's a lot.

128
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:44,624
Well, Ice Cube's like my opposite,
so she should lose 100 points or so.

129
00:05:46,368 --> 00:05:49,200
Spongy's too far ahead of everyone else now.

130
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:51,664
Let's take 100 points off him as well.

131
00:05:53,312 --> 00:05:56,784
Blocky was really mean to Bubble.
He should lose forty points.

132
00:05:58,912 --> 00:06:01,376
You have sixty points left to subtract.

133
00:06:01,376 --> 00:06:06,112
That's perfect! I'll take thirty points off
Leafy and Pencil for subtracting my score!

134
00:06:09,264 --> 00:06:12,416
And that's it. These are your current scores.

135
00:06:15,024 --> 00:06:17,264
Okay, you've caused enough craziness.

136
00:06:17,264 --> 00:06:20,016
Can you finally tell me who's up for elimination?

137
00:06:20,016 --> 00:06:22,320
Actually, all of you are up for elimination.

138
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,328
What? Huh? What?

139
00:06:23,328 --> 00:06:26,736
Except for Firey, because he
knocked down all ten pins.

140
00:06:26,736 --> 00:06:27,808
He has immunity.

141
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,200
- Yay!
- Grr!

142
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:31,648
Oh, green with envy, aren't you?

143
00:06:31,648 --> 00:06:33,936
That's the unique twist to this episode.

144
00:06:34,384 --> 00:06:37,280
So, voters. Everyone. Yes, you.

145
00:06:37,648 --> 00:06:40,752
Choose who you think should
leave the Battle for Dream Island.

146
00:06:40,752 --> 00:06:44,432
Cast your vote by typing it
in the comments section BELOW.

147
00:06:44,832 --> 00:06:46,448
Voting ends April 10th.

148
00:06:57,280 --> 00:07:01,760
Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh!
Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh!

149
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:04,736
ANNOUNCER:
Stay tuned for scenes from our next episode.

150
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:07,232
Wuehehweh, ooueheh-WEH!

151
00:07:07,392 --> 00:07:10,256
Isn't that a wonderful noise?

152
00:07:10,256 --> 00:07:14,400
Well, now you can listen to that noise 24/7

153
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:17,568
thanks to our revolutionary headphones!

154
00:07:17,776 --> 00:07:20,048
Listen to it while you walk.

155
00:07:20,048 --> 00:07:22,816
Listen to it while you sleep!

156
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:25,520
These headphones can only play that noise-

157
00:07:25,520 --> 00:07:27,520
and why would you ever want
to listen to anything else?

158
00:07:27,808 --> 00:07:30,176
They also have a volume up button.

159
00:07:31,008 --> 00:07:32,480
No volume down button.

160
00:07:32,656 --> 00:07:33,120
Wough.

161
00:07:33,312 --> 00:07:34,896
And best of all,

162
00:07:34,896 --> 00:07:37,952
our superglue makes them unremovable!

163
00:07:38,192 --> 00:07:41,168
So yeah, buy now!

164
00:07:41,392 --> 00:07:45,568
???
Next time, on BFDI...

165
00:07:45,568 --> 00:07:47,264
We will be throwing frisbees.

166
00:07:47,264 --> 00:07:48,768
Ooh, yay!

167
00:07:48,768 --> 00:07:49,488
Eh!

168
00:07:50,432 --> 00:07:53,280
And one recommended character will join the game.

169
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,256
[GASP!]